<details class="location-help">
    <summary>Review help: filters, highlights, and photo setup</summary>
    <dl class="location-help-topics">
        <div><dt>Which results are shown?</dt><dd>Ready to apply contains unattempted differences. Applied changes remain in Applied, All results, and Change History. Uncheck Show only different values and choose All results or Needs attention to include unchanged, unresolved, and failed results.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Are different names better?</dt><dd>Not necessarily. Inspect unfamiliar results in Lookup before selecting them. Resume pending writes in Change History; start a new scan for skipped or undone changes.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>What do highlights mean?</dt><dd>Highlighted characters differ exactly, including punctuation and capitalization. Changed spaces appear as ␠; invisible characters use symbols or Unicode codes. Hover over a highlight for character codes. A missing value is —; an empty value is (empty).</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Photo previews</dt><dd>Only differences request photo previews. They are not part of the saved snapshot and may become unavailable if an asset or its access changes.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <ImmichPhotoSetup ShowError="false" />
</details>
